The integration calls the original AirLLM reader and compiles a thin shim
against Colibrì's original tier.h. Upstream sources are not vendored here.
Their licenses and notices continue to apply to those dependencies.

The AirColibri project mark is an AI-assisted visual adaptation inspired by
AirLLM's rocket and Colibrì's pixel hummingbird. Original marks and names
remain associated with their respective authors. This integration and its
mark do not imply upstream endorsement. See assets/README.md for sources.
